12. Important Interpretation Notes
•	₹4.68B is revenue calculated across all order statuses; clearly label all-status versus delivered-only metrics.
•	The customers source table has duplicate IDs, so customer-level Power BI metrics should use distinct customer IDs or a customer dimension.
•	SUM(quantity) measures units; COUNT measures rows/orders and is not equivalent to quantity.
•	Revenue-based customer segmentation and RFM segmentation are separate analyses.
•	Power BI may display 9,932 as 10K when display units are set to Thousands.

